                                MEGASTORE 1.1
                               (c) DMC - 10/94

Introduction :
--------------

        MegaStore 1.1 is a program that compresses and uncompresses files. It
 is using the algorithm developed by Huffman. It gives very good results on
 text files (generally, less than 50%). .WVE files are not much reduced
 because they are already compressed (between 70% and 85%).

Installing MEGASTORE:
---------------------

        Copy MEGASTOR.APP either on your internal disk or on an SSD. Install it
 by using the install menu or Psion-I.

Using MEGASTORE :
-----------------

        MegaStore 1.1 takes a huge amount of RAM space (95K). This is due to
 the fact that big structures (arrays, buffers and trees) are used.

        In the menu File, you can either choose to compress or uncompress fils.
 A file selector comes and asks you to choose a source file and a destination
 file. They can both be on a remote drive. Once the file is compressed, a box
 displays the source size and the destination file, and a percentage which
 corresponds to the size remaining of the source file.
        When you uncompress, a box displays the size of the file restored.

