Version 1.1 Improvements :
--------------------------

        In this new version, the name of the original file is saved in the
compressed file so that the user doesn't have to reenter the whole name of
the uncompressed file when unpacking.

        A new menu called Convert will convert all files compressed with
MEGASTORE 1.0 to the same file utilisable by this new version. You will be
asked for the name of the original file (i.e. the one which has been compres-
-sed).

        A new directory M:\MST\ is created. All compressed files have
extension .MST by default and are store in this directory.


